      "en": "Your heart will meditate on the terror. Where is he who counted? Where is he who weighed? Where is he who counted the towers?",
      "ko": "너의 마음에는 두려워하던 것을 생각하여 내리라 계산하던 자가 어디 있느냐 공세를 칭량하던 자가 어디 있느냐 망대를 계수하던 자가 어디 있느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "5eae57cc52dc949c2a5530bacd4f657e82015c51b0f491996471f1da66cd4cbf",
      "translation_text_hash": "99b24d954b1bfe221e47afcddb8f29d07a8a63cb9e0fb599103af73339e35364",
